    "The proposed increased roof height, rear dormers and front wall, railings and gates would appear as an unacceptably dominant and visually intrusive feature in the street scene harmful to the established character and appearance of the surrounding area and appearing as a disproportionate and bulky addition to the host property, contrary to Policy 7 and 26 of the Havering Local Plan, and the Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document.",
